{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"ReportTransformations\">Report Transformations</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Create Custom Group Label On Port Reports ReportTransformation To ToDate\">Report transformation labels allow you to create custom categories for organizing and grouping data in your reports.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts Action Business Count Create Group Label On Other Port To ToDate Transaction Transactions\">Labels can be applied to accounts, transactions, or other report elements to create meaningful groupings that match your business needs.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Create Filter Label On Port Reports To ToDate\">Once created, these labels can be used across various reports to filter, summarize, or categorize information in ways that make sense for your organization.</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Name\">Name</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Name\">Name</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"By Filter Group Is Label Name On Port Reports ReportTransformation\">The name of the report transformation label. This name will appear in reports when grouping or filtering data by this label.</p></div></details>",
  "key": "report-transformation-labels"
}
